    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I guess that makes sense, but isn't there a real loss of quality though? It feels like if you strip away the actual craftsmanship and beauty just to make a point about a social issue, you're basically just making propaganda rather than \"art.\" Don't you think that makes the work less significant in the long run compared to stuff that stands on its own merit?",
